OL,3,GNEWSALives at risk if road not fixed,
OL,4,Acouncillor warns
OL,5,
OL,6,FA stretch of road at risk of collapsing
OL,7,Finto the River Avon must be repaired
OL,8,Furgently before it endangers lives, a
OL,9,Fcouncillor has warned.
OL,11,FCouncillor Sam Bastow, who represents
OL,12,Fthe town, said delaying repairs on
OL,13,FWorcester Road, Evesham, could also
OL,14,Fleave taxpayers facing a much larger
OL,15,Fbill.
OL,17,FAt a full council meeting, he suggested
OL,18,Ftemporary traffic lights had been in
OL,19,Fplace for months with "no sign of
OL,20,Factivity or progress" and asked
OL,21,FCouncillor Tom Wells for an update.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
